{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:01.36] Huh, uh\n[00:01.96] This my favorite part, nigga\n[00:05.16] Huh-uh, yeah\n[00:06.96] LordPhazer in this bitch (Hahahaha)\n[00:08.76] Uh-huh, oh, yeah\n[00:09.90] Ya dig?\n[00:10.42] Yeah\n[00:11.18] (Purps on the beat)\n[00:12.04] Here I go, here I go again (Here I go, here I go)\n[00:15.72] In Los Angeles, just came back from Japan\n[00:17.06] (In Los Angeles, just came back from Japan)\n[00:20.80] Here I go, here I go again, traveling, traveling (Here I go, here I go again, traveling)\n[Pre-Chorus]\n[00:25.66] Uh, here I go, here I go again\n[00:27.96] I'm in Los Angeles, I just came back from Japan (Uh-huh)\n[00:29.40] I was on Percocets everyday, wasn't fucking with them Xans (Uh-huh)\n[00:39.98] Here I go, here I go again (Yeah)\n[Chorus]\n[00:41.60] Here I go, here I go again (Uh-huh)\n[00:42.60] I'm in Los Angeles, I just came back from Japan (Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[00:44.72] Every day, I was doin' Percocets, wasn't fucking with them Xan's\n[00:47.64] (Uh-uh)\n[00:47.98] Turned studio to a trap house, like I was whipping with the pans (Uh) (Yeah, yeah)\n[00:52.26] I spent three thousand on some pants (Pants)\n[00:54.34] She a horny dog, she just fucked me and my mans (She a horny dog)\n[00:58.80] Yeah, a groupie and a fan (Yeah)\n[01:00.70] Still ain't trust her, so I fucked her with an Uzi in my hand (Grrah, grrah, grrah, grrah, grrah)\n[Verse 1]\n[01:05.82] Woah, rocking that Rick, dawg (Rick)\n[01:06.76] Feel like a big (Big), dog, I got the drip sauce (Drip sauce)\n[01:10.80] Pocket watching got you pissed off (Got you pissed off)\n[01:12.88] Just wait until you start staring at my wrist, dawg, ah (Gleam, gleam, gleam)\n[01:18.58] Let me not get superficial (Uh-huh)\n[01:19.82] I'm a sad boy when it come to heartbreak, it's in my lyrics (Uh-huh)\n[01:23.04] Y'all know that I got millions (Uh-huh), y'all know that I got a mansion (Uh-huh)\n[01:26.18] On top of mansion, that's a big building (Uh-huh)\n[01:27.72] Popping like wheelies, I put the \"Milli'\" in \"Million\"\n[01:30.02] Wrist so cold like the AC on (Uh-huh)\n[01:31.62] All I care 'bout is hunnids, I tear these twenties like an ACL (Uh-huh, rich)\n[01:35.06] What you know about money, uh\n[01:36.22] I got my throwback Gucci on (Yeah)\n[01:37.96] Finna get in that oochie coochie\n[01:39.58] Fuck a hoochie to this song, uh, uh, uh (Yeah, yeah, yeah)\n[01:42.38] Bootleg movies in my house, can't go to the movies, dog (Uh-uh)\n[01:45.18] I'm too important, they ask me if I have competition I say, \"Nah\" (Uh-uh)\n[01:48.20] They disappointed (Oh), I'm taking these pills, can't feel my jaw (Oh)\n[01:50.72] I think I need a doctor's appointment (Uh-huh), he tell me that nothing wrong\n[01:53.90] I still think that nigga wrong (Yeah, oh)\n[Chorus]\n[01:56.78] Here I go, here I go again\n[01:58.58] I'm in Los Angeles, I just came back from Japan (Yeah)\n[02:01.24] Every day, I was doin' Percocets, wasn't fucking with them Xans\n[02:04.36] Turned studio to a trap house, like I was whipping with the pans (Uh)\n[02:09.06] I spent three thousand on some pants (Three thousand on pants)\n[02:11.12] She a horny dog, she just fucked me and my mans (She just fucked me and my man, hahaha)\n[02:15.60] Yeah, a groupie and a fan (Yeah, she a fan)\n[02:17.58] Still ain't trust her, so I fucked her with an Uzi in my hand (Grrah, grrah, grrah, grrah, grrah, grrah, grrah)\n[Verse 2]\n[02:21.14] I see them haters watching me on the internet (On the web)\n[02:24.14] Like, \"Here he go, talkin' bout his new watch again\" (Gleam, gleam)\n[02:26.82] Haha, haha, hey (Yeah)\n[02:29.70] Like, \"That's a two-tone skeleton AP on his hand\" (I swear, bitch)\n[02:34.20] \"We get it,\" yeah, I know you get it (Huh)\n[02:36.92] But you couldn't afford it if you worked for your life, nigga\n[02:39.44] That's your forever girl?\n[02:41.70] I just may go rent her (Smash)\n[02:43.32] And drive that bitch around like a Mercedes Sprinter (Skrrt)\n[02:46.92] So much money, they think I got a money printer (Yeah)\n[02:49.58] So much drama, sometimes I think I'm on Jerry Springer (What the fuck?)\n[02:52.88] I know some of these racist motherfuckers hate to pay up\n[02:55.76] Like, \"Why the hell did we just have to book this dirty nigga?\" (Hahaha)\n[02:59.52] Uh, times change (Yeah), but I still got that mask on my face like I'm in the KKK (Let's go)\n[03:04.20] Bought a brand-new guitar, and a piano, and a brand-new AK (Let's go)\n[03:07.60] Yeah, just in case, a fuck nigga get in my way (Uh-huh)\n[03:10.22] .233 shots to a nigga in his face, take two off his top like he gettin' a fade\n[03:13.00] Send 'em Roc Block niggas around your way\n[03:14.64] Bought a new watch, cost over 100k (Gleam)\n[03:16.14] So bright, can't see the time today (Damn)\n[03:18.02] Yeah, but it's my time today (It is)\n[03:20.02] I'm gon' shine today (I am)\n[03:21.22] Yesterday, tomorrow, ayy, that mean I'm in my prime, okay\n[Chorus]\n[03:25.60] Here I go, here I go again (Here I go again)\n[03:28.16] I'm in Los Angeles, I just came back from Japan (I just came back from Japan)\n[03:37.94] I was on Percocets every day, wasn't fucking with them Xans (I wasn't fucking with them Xans)\n[03:40.40] Here I go, here I go again\n[03:41.16] Here I go, here I go again\n[03:41.80] I'm in Los Angeles, I just came back from Japan\n[03:43.64] Every day, I was doin' Percocets, wasn't fucking with them Xans\n[03:46.58] Turned studio to a trap house, like I was whipping with the pans\n[03:50.74] (Uh)\n[03:51.40] I spent three thousand on some pants (Three thousand on some pants)\n[03:53.84] She a horny dog, she just fucked me and my mans (She just fucked me and my fucking mans)\n[04:05.60] Yeah, a groupie and a fan (Yeah, groupie and a fan)\n[04:09.10] Still ain't trust her, so I fucked her with a Uzi in my hand (In my motherfucking hand)\n[Outro]\n[04:12.96] Woah\n[04:13.16] Yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah-yeah\n[04:17.80] Triple nine the gang, you know it, yeah